@startuml
!theme plain
autonumber
hide footbox

title 接力规划模式：基于 static_plan 参照逻辑的目标事件时序

actor "执行 Bot A\n上游节点" as bot_a
database "TaskGraphService" as graph
queue "Outbox / Event Bus" as events
participant "TaskPlanner\nRelayPlanningStrategy" as planner
participant "TaskDispatcher" as dispatcher
participant "TaskRunner" as runner
actor "接力 Bot B" as bot_b

== A 完成，图谱产生下一次规划请求 ==
bot_a -> graph : report(TaskCallbackData\nEXECUTION_RESULT, A result, graph_version=18)
graph -> graph : 校验版本、幂等、状态机\n持久化 A=SUCCESS 与输出
graph -> events : 原子写 PLAN_REQUESTED(TaskContext v19)
events -> planner : 消费 PLAN_REQUESTED(context)

note right of planner
参照 static_plan：根据已完成产出、依赖、
验收/gap 和策略决定下一步。
TaskPlanner 只看 TaskContext，不读写完整图谱。
end note

planner -> graph : report(TaskCallbackData\nPLAN, PlanResult)
graph -> graph : 校验接力策略、版本、深度、规则
graph -> events : 原子写 DISPATCH_REQUESTED(relay node B)

== 派发接力节点并启动 ==
events -> dispatcher : 消费 DISPATCH_REQUESTED(node B)
dispatcher -> dispatcher : 选择接力 Bot / run_mode
dispatcher -> graph : report(TaskCallbackData\nDISPATCH, TaskNodePatch)
graph -> events : 原子写 EXECUTION_REQUESTED(node B)
events -> runner : 消费 EXECUTION_REQUESTED(node B)
runner -> bot_b : 启动既有 executor\n(允许的节点上下文)
runner -> graph : report(TaskCallbackData\nEXECUTION_STARTED 或 START_FAILED)

== B 基于最新上下文继续接力规划 ==
bot_b -> graph : report(TaskCallbackData\nPLAN, PlanResult, graph_version=current)
graph -> graph : 校验归属/租约、版本、幂等、\n节点边关系与深度
graph -> events : 原子写 DISPATCH_REQUESTED(child C)
events -> dispatcher : dispatch(node C)
dispatcher -> graph : report(DISPATCH, TaskNodePatch)
graph -> events : EXECUTION_REQUESTED(node C)
events -> runner : run(node C)

note over graph,runner
任何完成、失败或恢复事实都会回到统一 report 入口，
由图谱状态决定下一条语义事件。版本过期、重复或越权的接力规划
被拒绝，不会直接增删节点，也不会触发外部执行副作用。
end note

@enduml
